## Data attribution

The raw data under `data/` comes from public sources published by the Government
of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region. Copyright remains with the
respective providers, and the data is used under their open data terms:

| Data | Provider | Source |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Flu Express figures | Department of Health, Centre for Health Protection | data.gov.hk |
| Key Statistics during Service Demand Surge | Hospital Authority | data.gov.hk |
| Inpatient and Day Inpatient Services Throughput | Hospital Authority | data.gov.hk |
| Ambulatory and Community Services Throughput | Hospital Authority | data.gov.hk |
| Hospital / institution list | Hospital Authority | data.gov.hk |
| Daily temperature | Hong Kong Observatory | HKO Open Data API |

The MIT licence above does not apply to this data. Official dataset metadata and
source links for each dataset are recorded in `data/raw/_provenance.json`.
